  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a cataplana over medium heat until shimmering.",
    "Add minced garlic and sauté for 30 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Stir in berbere spice, and cook for another minute to release aromas.",
    "Pour in cooked chickpeas, lentils, and vegetable broth; bring to a gentle boil.",
    "Reduce heat, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes to meld flavors.",
    "Stir in chopped pistachios and lemon juice, season with salt and pepper, and serve hot."
